lor":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-03-23T21:29:12Z","updated_at":"2025-03-23T23:44:35Z","closed_at":"2025-03-23T23:44:29Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.4.stable.official [4c311cbee], v4.4.1.rc2.official [abef5e0d2], v4.5.dev1.official [97241ffea]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon(TM) Graphics (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.21916.2) - AMD Ryzen 7 5700U with Radeon Graphics (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen a subwindow is both embedded and set to the Canvas Items content scale mode, the contents of the window are not scaled at all. The subwindow will scale its contents as expected if it isn't embedded (e.g. if Embed Subwindows is unchecked in project settings), or if the Viewport content scale mode is used instead.\n\nThis happens in the Forward+, Mobile, and Compability renderers.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. In project settings, set `display/window/subwindows/embed_subwindows` to `true`\n2. Create a Window node and put something in it. Then set the window's size and content scale size to values that would trigger content scaling (e.g. `size = Vector2i(256, 256)` and `content_scale_size = Vector2i(128, 128)`)\n3. Set the content scale mode to Canvas Items\n4. The window contents are not resized\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[Window Scale Mode.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19411434/Window.Scale.Mode.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104531/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104531/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}